<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Plugins — ZystemWorkSpace</title><style>body{font:15px system-ui;background:#080d14;color:#e8eef7;max-width:1000px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 16px}section{background:#101a28;border:1px solid #29405d;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:12px 0}textarea,input,button{padding:9px;margin:4px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #385474;background:#0c1522;color:#eee}button{cursor:pointer;background:#193b5d}.plugin{padding:10px;border-top:1px solid #29405d}</style><h1>Plugins de IA</h1><p><a href="index.php">Chat</a> · <a href="settings.php">Configurações</a></p><section><p>O teste é dry-run: valida manifesto e ferramentas, mas não executa PHP, shell, Python ou código externo.</p><textarea id="manifest" rows="8" cols="70">{"name":"exemplo","version":"1.0.0","description":"Plugin de teste","tools":[{"name":"saudacao","description":"Retorna uma saudação"}]}</textarea><br><button id="test">Testar manifesto</button><button id="seed">Instalar catálogo local</button><pre id="out"></pre></section><section id="list">Carregando...</section><script>const $=s=>document.querySelector(s);async function load(){const d=await fetch('../api/plugins.php?action=list').then(r=>r.json());$('#list').innerHTML=(d.items||[]).map(p=>`<div class="plugin"><b>${p.name}</b> v${p.version}<br>${p.description||''}</div>`).join('')||'Nenhum plugin instalado.'}$('#test').onclick=async()=>{try{const d=await fetch('../api/plugins.php',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action:'test',manifest:JSON.parse($('#manifest').value)})}).then(r=>r.json());$('#out').textContent=JSON.stringify(d,null,2)}catch(e){$('#out').textContent=e.message}};document.querySelector('#seed').onclick=async()=>{try{const d=await fetch('../api/plugins.php',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action:'seed'})}).then(r=>r.json());$('#out').textContent=JSON.stringify(d,null,2);load()}catch(e){$('#out').textContent=e.message}};load()</script>
